msgid "### **Level 1**\n"
"This logical equivalence is sometimes called **Proof by cases**. We'll use this (and variants thereof) a lot in the future (with the help of a tactic). It basically tells us how to approach proofs where we have a hypothesis in the form a disjunction.\n"
"\n"
"We'll need two new laws of logic to pass this level. 🔍 Check out the entries for §0 and §1."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `⊻`
