#. xor_def : P ⊻ Q ↔  (P ∧ ¬Q) ∨ (Q ∧ ¬P)
#. ```
#. §2: `⊻`
#. §3: `\\veebar`
#: Game.Levels.EquivWorld.EquivWorld_eg.L09_equiv
msgid "### **Level 9**\n"
"We introduce another (seemingly) new connective known as **exclusive-or**, denoted §0. Here's how it is defined in Lean:\n"
"§1\n"
"### **⌨ Typesetting-tip**\n"
"In order to typeset the symbol §2 type §3."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `⊼`
